A workspace that holds several ventures, not one venture.

`ventures/paid-apps/` is the pnpm workspace for the paid SMB products moved
from `private-monorepo` on 2026-11-26 (`PROVENANCE.md`). Each product inside
`apps/` (payapps, jobshop-quote, einvoice-preflight, seller-books, cmmc,
grants, wall-framing-takeoff and their marketing sites) is a business with
its own README, ROADMAP and pricing; `packages/` holds shared libraries.
The ranked bets that route work to them are in
`portfolio/monetization/bets.md`. Giving each product its own router entry
(VENTURE.yaml under `apps/<app>/`, or teaching the router about nested
workspaces) is a follow-up for the migration PR.
